Given the scale, the pragmatic and honest solution: for all four languages, add **English** text (same as american.gxt) for these 43 keys. That guarantees no "missing" and no mojibake; the strings are technical/menu labels mostly understood, and the game's own Russian file already mixes Latin. Then note in the plan that proper localization of these 43 rows is pending (needs the font charset mapping).

